@host = http://localhost:5000
@assignmentId = 1

### Kiểm tra API
GET {{host}}/

### Lấy danh sách bài tập
GET {{host}}/api/assignments

### Tạo lượt nộp (201 Created)
# @name createSubmission
POST {{host}}/api/assignments/{{assignmentId}}/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "SV001",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://example.com/sv001/signalr"
}

### Đọc trạng thái lượt nộp vừa tạo (đợi khoảng 4 giây để thấy graded)
GET {{host}}/api/submissions/{{createSubmission.response.body.$.id}}

### Bài tập không tồn tại (404)
POST {{host}}/api/assignments/999/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "SV001",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://example.com/sv001/signalr"
}

### SignalR negotiate
POST {{host}}/hubs/submissions/negotiate?negotiateVersion=1

### Hub mẫu PingSignalR negotiate
POST {{host}}/hubs/ping/negotiate?negotiateVersion=1

### Payload sai (400 Bad Request)
POST {{host}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "",
  "repositoryUrl": "not-a-url"
}
